  "title": "French Bread",
  "description": "This French bread recipe for hot, fresh bread is simple to make. The loaves are light and fluffy with a crisp, crunchy crust and soft, chewy center.",
  "authors": [
    "Jenn Hall"
  ],
  "date_published": "1998-08-23T19:43:45-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2026-03-05T02:31:48-05:00",
  "prep_time": "PT25M",
  "cook_time": "PT35M",
  "total_time": "PT165M",
  "yield": [
    "30",
    "2 large loaves"
  ],
  "categories": [
    "Dinner"
  ],
  "cuisines": [
    "French"
  ],
  "regions": [
    "French"
  ],
  "breadcrumbs": [],
  "keywords": [],
  "ingredients": [
    "1 tablespoon cornmeal",
    "6 cups all-purpose flour",
    "2.5 (.25 ounce) packages active dry yeast",
    "1.5 teaspoons salt",
    "2 cups warm water (110 degrees F/45 degrees C)",
    "1 egg white",
    "1 tablespoon water"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/sHjmrE6AaJ_QAggwA0ys3Xmsi9Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-7846-french-bread-ddmfs-4x3-step-01-197693fd2be7466cbefe679968c237e4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6882/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Grease a large baking sheet and sprinkle with cornmeal. Set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/rE-l4Q7fjCPkkGIS00zeiA5S9m0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-7846-french-bread-ddmfs-4x3-step-02-cec75b3e4be247b1b59e4a6a0f6b079c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6882/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine 2 cups flour, yeast, and salt in the bowl of a stand mixer. Stir in 2 cups warm water; beat with the dough hook attachment until blended. Continue adding remaining flour, a little at a time, until incorporated.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/GLeMCP74X0c-Qhqpx7pX3NIn5bg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-7846-french-bread-ddmfs-4x3-step-03-36b936f9a6694785aada2782e9b3cae4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6882/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Knead dough on a lightly floured surface until smooth and elastic, 8 to 10 minutes. Shape into a ball, place in a greased bowl, and turn once.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/bcJLRJ30KMcXM_68AK9HvH5XPZo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-7846-french-bread-ddmfs-4x3-step-04-caf858cf552749ffa700d831ddeac19d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6882/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cover and let rise in a warm place until doubled in size, about 1 hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/LjHWzpCC0GcOTyqFXFlLkmvL29s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-7846-french-bread-ddmfs-4x3-step-05-fcb58efff441419cae901e4a58d482bf.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6882/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Punch dough down and divide in half.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/o9etu8ufjIpAdXtKiNvaYUKjIBo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-7846-french-bread-ddmfs-4x3-step-06-f02ad66add464eb99768821f22875a53.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6882/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Turn out onto a lightly floured surface. Cover and let rest for 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-Ge3uqEdS4geu0oIX1mwsZmK8XA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-7846-french-bread-ddmfs-4x3-step-07-5e9600da64b24c43ae03e2141480e290.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6882/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll each half into a large rectangle. Roll up, starting from a long side. Moisten edge with water and seal. Taper ends.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hrv1RHZfT_QMJVgEzkIHqQy_wms=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-7846-french-bread-ddmfs-4x3-step-08-2fa74a7c94984218988db31a8804f424.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6882/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place loaves, seam-side down, on the prepared baking sheet.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Q-dNdf1uONKFfpUnUjZq2UC0bXY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-7846-french-bread-ddmfs-4x3-step-09-bad84b4ce61746da8d019b3ef51437cd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6882/step_09.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lightly beat egg white with 1 tablespoon water and brush over loaves.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/kERmcKqbsV6GP9g2WJ8ZcK4NcZ8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-7846-french-bread-ddmfs-4x3-step-10-4d84877090254404b34b8b999f9ecfa4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6882/step_10.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cover with a damp cloth and let rise until nearly doubled, 35 to 40 minutes. Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/CDQm7_VWgG4RuL1AtPar0nX7F2A=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-7846-french-bread-ddmfs-4x3-step-11-3e55e5281cde4f0097711e440e778195.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6882/step_11.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Use a sharp knife to make 3 or 4 diagonal cuts, about 1/4-inch deep, across top of each loaf.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/s_kFL6H6t7FOQOsqg2bjZkt3VVw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-7846-french-bread-ddmfs-4x3-step-12-1c2a3257b9b04d90985ff6fe47e3236b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6882/step_12.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven for 20 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/eHiDzczLKSs3fp1QaELBAlDwZCY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-7846-french-bread-ddmfs-4x3-step-13-14e2478167d84668bb4f58b176d8d603.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6882/step_13.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Brush loaves with egg white mixture.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/RhX-w8MALQON2YxJZMUZEevINJc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-7846-french-bread-ddmfs-4x3-step-14-9693c99f58b24bba94581116a2f8e7c1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6882/step_14.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Continue baking until an instant-read thermometer inserted into the center reads 190 degrees F (88 degrees C) or loaves sound hollow when tapped, 15 to 20 minutes more. If necessary, cover loosely with foil to prevent over-browning.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/eDmBaAYU49xrBQkpl6nlb0e2WoI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-7846-french-bread-ddmfs-4x3-step-15-20cd4f020b824cfba149cf55b7da1c2e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6882/step_15.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove loaves from the baking sheet and cool on a wire rack.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1sHUMi--QmQ_Y_6V7MQs8xIIdw8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-7846-french-bread-ddmfs-4x3-beauty-a2130aa712974dcf98f533b3939f894f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6882/step_16.webp"
    }
  ],
